Distance Calculator Program
Description

This program converts a distance from kilometers to miles. It uses a conversion factor of 0.621371 miles for every kilometer. The program also allows the user to convert another distance.

How to Run the Program
Open the distance_calculator.py file.
Run the program using Python.
Enter the distance in kilometers.
Choose yes or no when asked if you want to convert another distance.
Input Needed

The program needs:

A distance in kilometers
A yes or no response to continue
Sample Output
Enter distance in kilometers: 10
Distance in miles: 6.21371
Do you want to convert another distance? (yes/no): no
Program ended.
